      "text": "```\n  LLM Inference — The Full Stack\n  ================================"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md#003",
      "path": [
        "08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:ai-engineering:08-inference-deployment, git-history:ai-engineering:08-inference-deployment]",
        "canonical_path": "ai-engineering/08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md",
        "concepts": "[inference, deployment]",
        "current_path": "ai-engineering/08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md",
        "id": "maxim:ai-engineering:inference-deployment",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "ai-engineering",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[inference, deployment]",
        "section": "ai-engineering",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "08 - Inference Optimization and Serving",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  REQUEST                                                             │\n  │  Prompt tokens (input) → KV Cache (prefill) → Output tokens (decode) │\n  └──────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────┘\n                                 │\n  ┌──────────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  ATTENTION LAYER                                                     │\n  │  Attention(Q,K,V) — the quadratic bottleneck                         │\n  │  Optimizations: FlashAttention, MQA, GQA, linear attention           │\n  └──────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────┘\n                                 │\n  ┌──────────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  MEMORY LAYER                                                        │\n  │  KV cache management — the primary GPU memory constraint             │\n  │  PagedAttention (vLLM): virtual memory paging for KV cache           │\n  │  Prefix caching: reuse KV state for repeated system prompts          │\n  └──────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────┘\n                                 │\n  ┌──────────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  COMPUTE LAYER                                                       │\n  │  Quantization: FP16 → INT8 → INT4 (size, quality, speed tradeoffs)   │\n  │  Speculative decoding: draft model accelerates large model           │\n  └──────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────┘\n                                 │\n  ┌──────────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  SERVING LAYER                                                       │\n  │  Continuous batching · Request scheduling · Load balancing           │\n  │  vLLM · TGI · SGLang · Triton · Ollama                               │\n  └──────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────┘\n                                 │\n  ┌──────────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  DEPLOYMENT PATTERN                                                  │\n  │  Serverless API · Dedicated GPU cluster · Edge/local                 │\n  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```"
    },
