        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "08 - Inference Optimization and Serving",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  Why KV Cache Exists\n  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md#007",
      "path": [
        "08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:ai-engineering:08-inference-deployment, git-history:ai-engineering:08-inference-deployment]",
        "canonical_path": "ai-engineering/08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md",
        "concepts": "[inference, deployment]",
        "current_path": "ai-engineering/08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md",
        "id": "maxim:ai-engineering:inference-deployment",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "ai-engineering",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[inference, deployment]",
        "section": "ai-engineering",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "08 - Inference Optimization and Serving",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Autoregressive decoding: generate one token at a time.\n  To generate token t_n, attention needs Q, K, V for all tokens t_1...t_{n-1}."
    },
    {
      "id": "08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md#008",
      "path": [
        "08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:ai-engineering:08-inference-deployment, git-history:ai-engineering:08-inference-deployment]",
        "canonical_path": "ai-engineering/08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md",
        "concepts": "[inference, deployment]",
        "current_path": "ai-engineering/08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md",
        "id": "maxim:ai-engineering:inference-deployment",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "ai-engineering",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[inference, deployment]",
        "section": "ai-engineering",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "08 - Inference Optimization and Serving",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Without caching (naive):\n    At each step, recompute K and V for ALL previous tokens\n    Step n: n × d_model matrix multiplications\n    Total compute: O(n²) per token generated → catastrophically slow"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md#009",
      "path": [
        "08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:ai-engineering:08-inference-deployment, git-history:ai-engineering:08-inference-deployment]",
        "canonical_path": "ai-engineering/08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md",
        "concepts": "[inference, deployment]",
        "current_path": "ai-engineering/08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md",
        "id": "maxim:ai-engineering:inference-deployment",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "ai-engineering",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[inference, deployment]",
        "section": "ai-engineering",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "08 - Inference Optimization and Serving",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "With KV cache:\n    Store K and V tensors for all previously processed tokens\n    At step n: compute K, V only for the NEW token t_n\n    Append to cache. Compute attention using cached K, V.\n    Total compute: O(n) per token generated"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md#010",
      "path": [
        "08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:ai-engineering:08-inference-deployment, git-history:ai-engineering:08-inference-deployment]",
        "canonical_path": "ai-engineering/08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md",
        "concepts": "[inference, deployment]",
        "current_path": "ai-engineering/08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md",
        "id": "maxim:ai-engineering:inference-deployment",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "ai-engineering",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[inference, deployment]",
        "section": "ai-engineering",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "08 - Inference Optimization and Serving",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Memory footprint formula:\n    KV cache bytes = 2 × num_layers × num_heads × d_head × context_len × bytes_per_element"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md#011",
      "path": [
        "08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:ai-engineering:08-inference-deployment, git-history:ai-engineering:08-inference-deployment]",
        "canonical_path": "ai-engineering/08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md",
        "concepts": "[inference, deployment]",
        "current_path": "ai-engineering/08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md",
        "id": "maxim:ai-engineering:inference-deployment",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "ai-engineering",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[inference, deployment]",
        "section": "ai-engineering",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "08 - Inference Optimization and Serving",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Example: Llama-3-8B\n    num_layers = 32, num_heads = 32, d_head = 128 (= 4096/32), FP16 = 2 bytes\n    context_len = 8192 tokens\n    2 × 32 × 32 × 128 × 8192 × 2 = ~4.3 GB per sequence"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md#012",
      "path": [
        "08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:ai-engineering:08-inference-deployment, git-history:ai-engineering:08-inference-deployment]",
        "canonical_path": "ai-engineering/08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md",
        "concepts": "[inference, deployment]",
        "current_path": "ai-engineering/08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md",
        "id": "maxim:ai-engineering:inference-deployment",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "ai-engineering",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[inference, deployment]",
        "section": "ai-engineering",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "08 - Inference Optimization and Serving",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "For batched serving at context_len=8192, batch_size=16:\n    4.3 GB × 16 = ~69 GB — exceeds a single A100 80GB with model weights"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md#013",
      "path": [
        "08-INFERENCE-DEPLOYMENT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:ai-engineering:08-inference-deployment, git-history:ai-engineering:08-inference-deployment]",
